{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>温哥華豐泰超市FoodyWorld｜最新一期特價優惠Flyer已經登場，由即日至8月20日，涵蓋了小食、熟食、急凍至雜貨零食。其中包括每磅16.99加元的游水加拿大龍蝦、每磅2.99加元的新鮮排骨，以及生猛殼蠔與多款燒烤醬料，如果準備周末家庭聚餐或戶外烤肉，就要把握入貨時機。為了幫大家節省逛超市的時間，本文特別挑選出本期CP值最高的重點商品與熟食推薦！</p><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜ 小食類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜ 小食類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164905270510882816432187.jpeg/WrbDPuRseigg2kYXsYPevzlvU61C8wdonffA7p33wO4\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜ 小食類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜熟食類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜熟食類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164910109634203648270916.png/Phy0yYoMm9MS_em1qfYl2lgJUivKxzq5MgPREzID0RM\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜熟食類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜煮食類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜蔬果煮食類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164910107268485120280749.png/tRsfR4cOKfaEN6czFDQMPwrDSDH-imoBEA8u-BAPLvg\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜蔬果煮食類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜美妝鮮花類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜美妝鮮花類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164911462741839872914670.png/w1MALiTWITp_q1oEGiS3YrPOWJDmxz8g5A8or-QPKK8\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜美妝鮮花類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜蔬果類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜蔬果類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164911460204154880975380.png/Z0Zkp2ng-46YbE5d_UU9NIhMJt216mBnjw2Ft48Nhbc\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜蔬果類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜肉類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜肉類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164912077484593152501482.png/wXZfLBzKeiO3n9LXVVZHulYCTXLebuDHbrvgjG674Iw\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜肉類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜海鮮類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜海鮮類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164912075441836032518439.png/2v6Llq5A9LsvOYjvsHQ_LlRvCJLG60O6xmd1O8ZndTs\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜海鮮類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜燒烤類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜燒烤類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164912072979648512918760.png/Pe5hajs-vCBYaLoWfUk7qcHbze1u_OSLciWT-XIlk_k\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜燒烤類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜急凍類</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜急凍類\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164912070844616704315894.png/6RcV_QYMdnhPM4l8e2b6Gm7s0B8uJHXvpwS426cEuNs\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜急凍類</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市本周特價｜雜貨零食</p><figure><img alt=\"豐泰超市本周特價｜雜貨零食\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164912068227239936764290.png/PwL2pN-nmZ2xtXuSZnf0Xr4rCR8KguORwIJeYsCCXmI\"/><figcaption>豐泰超市本周特價｜雜貨零食</figcaption></figure><p>豐泰超市｜營業開放時間</p><p>上午9時至晚上12時</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T15:19:00.163247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":468,"images":10,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}